{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"深圳市政協前主席戴北方涉受賄被起訴\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CN-CORRUPT-261110-11.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】深圳市政協前主席戴北方涉嫌受賄被起訴。</p><p>案情指，戴北方利用擔任深圳鹽田區委書記、深圳市政協黨組書記、主席等職務上的便利，為他人謀取利益，非法收受他人財物，數額巨大。國家監察委員會完成調查，移送檢察機關審查起訴。海南省檢察院第一分院近日向海南省第一中級法院提起公訴。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.554081+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T02:39:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T07:27:50.385642+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:08.685551+00:00","content_hash":"0bbf077156a2b68dbdab956cbb1219289ed942b2ee94eb5d557163c46ffa3c9b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.554081+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}